    <string name="autofill_how_title">How Autofill works</string>
    <string name="autofill_how_body_1">When you focus a login field, Android asks Passcodes for matching credentials. Passcodes then provides matching entries as Autofill suggestions.</string>
    <string name="autofill_how_body_2">Your passwords remain inside Passcodes and are only provided when Android requests an Autofill operation.</string>

